msgid "Daily Testing"
msgstr "Testes Diários"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: contributor-docs/C/qa-testing.xml:87
msgid ""
"The importance of daily image testing lies mainly in knowing that boot "
"and/or installation regressions haven’t appeared. Where it appears they "
"have, if you are able to boot with a different flavours image, this can help"
" prove a global or local to Xubuntu issue. If unsure contact the Xubuntu "
"team, preferably on IRC."
msgstr ""
"A importância dos testes às imagens diárias prendem-se essencialmente\n"
"em garantir que não ocorrem regressões no arranque e/ou instalação. Quando\n"
